alse},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"10","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"11db13be","settings":{"editor":"<p>Depois de dois meses, ele tava com uma\u00a0<span class=\"cripto\">\u200bp\u200b\u043e\u200bt\u200b\u00ea\u200bn\u200b\u0441\u200b\u0456\u200b\u0430<\/span>\u00a0impressionante no\u00a0<span class=\"cripto\">\u200bs\u200be\u200bx\u200bo<\/span>\u00a0e o\u00a0<span class=\"cripto\">\u200b\u0440\u200b\u00ea\u200bn\u200b\u0456\u200b\u0455<\/span>\u00a0dele tava maior, eu sentia muito\u00a0<span class=\"cripto\">\u200bp\u200br\u200ba\u200bz\u200be\u200br<\/span>\u00a0e estava tendo orgasmos que nunca havia tido antes\"<\/p>","align_mobile":"left","_margin_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"-24","right":"0","bottom":"-24","left":"0","isLinked":false},"text_color":"#3E3E3E","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","typography_line_height_mobile":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]},"_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"-26","right":"0","bottom":"-26","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"55cf0f2","settings":{"content_width":"full","border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"2","isLinked":false},"border_color":"#A80000","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"10","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"20cd48ec","settings":{"editor":"<p>\"Logo nos primeiros dias que o Roberto come\u0